WEBVTT

00:01:27.598 --> 00:01:30.130
Jesam li imao besane noći zbog ove poruke?

00:01:31.205 --> 00:01:32.355
Ne.

00:01:32.748 --> 00:01:38.579
Nisam htio dopustiti da mi
politički pothvat remeti snove.

00:01:38.952 --> 00:01:40.722
(Smijeh)

00:01:40.746 --> 00:01:42.428
Deset godina kasnije,

00:01:43.865 --> 00:01:46.386
u veljači ove godine,

00:01:46.410 --> 00:01:48.690
vidio sam ovo izvješće.

00:01:50.163 --> 00:01:54.154
To izvješće je pokazalo

00:01:54.178 --> 00:02:00.332
da bi se jedna trećina leda
planine Hindu Kush na Himalaji